# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and credentials
#
# This repo is intended to be PUBLIC. Nothing below should ever reach a commit.
# The notifier reads every secret from environment variables injected by GitHub
# Actions Secrets at runtime -- no credential is ever written to disk by design.
# These rules are defense-in-depth for anything created by hand while testing.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example

# ESPN cookies (ESPN_S2 / SWID) pulled from the browser
cookies.txt
cookies.json
espn_cookies*
swid*
*.cookies

# Discord webhook URLs -- a webhook URL is a credential; anyone holding it can
# post to your channel. Never paste one into a tracked file.
webhook*.txt
webhook*.json
discord_webhook*

# Generic credential material
secrets/
secrets.*
credentials.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*_rsa
*_rsa.pub
.netrc

# Local overrides that tend to accumulate real values
config.local.*
local_settings.py
settings.local.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Planning / working files -- local only, not part of the published repo
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLAUDE.md
TASKS.md
status.md
.claude/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test artifacts that may contain real league data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
tests/fixtures/real_*
tests/fixtures/live_*
*.live.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs and scratch output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
dry-run-output.txt
scratch/
tmp/

# Temp file from save_state()'s atomic write. Renamed into place immediately,
# but a crash mid-write could strand one next to the real state.json.
.state-*.tmp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   state.json  -- the notifier's only persistence. The workflow commits it back
#                  each run, so ignoring it would re-bootstrap every single run.
#                  It must contain ONLY: last_activity_ms, opaque fingerprints,
#                  week numbers, and reminder keys. Never player names, scores,
#                  team names, league id, or anything read from a cookie.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
